This project grew out of a university database course project, "Database Design
for Insurance Company" (Lebanese American University, December 2022), written by:

  Bilal Delbani
  Omar Temsah
  Mohammad Al Fallah
  Mohammad Alizzi

The entity-relationship design, the relational mapping, the sample data and the
ten business scenarios in this repository are derived from that joint work.
The original report is included unchanged in docs/original/ for reference.

The MIT License in LICENSE applies to the code, SQL and documentation written for
this repository. The original report (docs/original/safe-hands-report-2022.pdf)
is the joint work of its four authors; please credit all of them if you reuse it.

All people, companies, addresses, phone numbers and records in the data are
fictional. Email addresses use the reserved example.com domain (RFC 2606).

